{"id":"e591de700289dd8f","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-morley.md","title":"Morley's Categoricity Theorem","display":"thm-morley — Morley's Categoricity Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-morley","aliases":["58-thm-morley"],"display":"thm-morley — Morley's Categoricity Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[58-df-categoricity]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-model6-complete-theory.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-morley"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-morley</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-morley — Morley's Categoricity Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"058c412328d32071\" href=\"?note=058c412328d32071\" title=\"58-df-categoricity\">58-df-categoricity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a4d3c71685246c85\" href=\"?note=a4d3c71685246c85\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-model6-complete-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-model6-complete-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteTheory}_S(L,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteTheory}_S(L,T)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(L))\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(L))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\kappa)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"058c412328d32071\" href=\"?note=058c412328d32071\" title=\"58-df-categoricity\">58-df-categoricity</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0&lt;\\kappa,\\lambda\">\\(\\aleph_0&lt;\\kappa,\\lambda\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(L)\\)</span> 是该语言的关系、函数及常量符号载体之并，不是编码记录本身。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}morley} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteTheory}_S(L,T)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(L))\\land\\exists\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\aleph_0&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\kappa)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\aleph_0&lt;\\lambda\\to\\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\lambda)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}morley} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel6CompleteTheory}_S(L,T)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(L))\\land\\exists\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\aleph_0&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\kappa)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\to\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\aleph_0&lt;\\lambda\\to\\mathrm{Categorical}_S(T,L,\\lambda)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>完备性、可数语言和“一阶理论”是 Morley 定理不可省略的作用域条件。</li>\n<li>This is a landmark in model theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-categoricity","status":"resolved","id":"058c412328d32071","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-categoricity]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-model6-complete-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"a4d3c71685246c85","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-model6-complete-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-categoricity","status":"resolved","id":"058c412328d32071","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[